      "writtenOn": "2025-07-21T16:02:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The code never sets `instruction_set_v2 \u003d false`.  If only V2 devices need the WDT check, I suggest doing the following.\n\n```\n    /* Always attempt to restart the WDT.  For V1 devices this\n     * does nothing.\n     */\n    conf-\u003einstruction_set_v2 \u003d true;\n    restart_wdt(conf);\n    \n    /* Read chip-id */\n    ...\n    \n    if (chip_id_is_v2)\n        conf-\u003einstruction_set_v2 \u003d true;\n    else\n        conf-\u003einstruction_set_v1 \u003d false;",
